sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Authenticated source
  participant I as Intake
  participant G as Governor
  participant R as Router
  participant E as Registered executor
  participant C as Canonical state
  S->>I: request + correlation ID
  I->>I: schema, ID, freshness, replay, credential
  alt rejected
    I-->>S: terminal rejection
  else authenticated
    I->>G: normalized candidate
    G->>G: policy + access + state checks
    alt denied or expired
      G-->>S: fail closed
    else approved
      G->>R: immutable approved request
      R->>E: atomic handoff to eligible executor
      E-->>R: transport acknowledgement
      Note over R,C: acknowledgement is not success
      alt terminal receipt arrives and validates
        E->>C: correlated authoritative receipt
        C-->>S: publish final state
      else timeout / mismatch / late evidence
        C-->>S: pending, failed, or quarantined
      end
    end
  end
